mcpelauncher-linker
Copyright (c) 2024 ChristopherHX and MCMrARM
Licensed under the MIT License.
https://github.com/minecraft-linux/mcpelauncher-linker

third_party/mcpelauncher-linker/ is the ported AOSP bionic linker Cordial loads
libroblox.so with. crates/cordial-linker-sys/build.rs compiles bionic/linker and
bionic/libdl from it, so it is statically linked into every binary shipped here
and nothing loads without it. The MIT text is kept beside it at
third_party/mcpelauncher-linker/LICENSE.

Local changes are not committed into the submodule, which belongs to somebody
else and has nowhere to push. They live as patches in patches/ with a README
saying what each one is for.
