OpenXR headers
Copyright 2017-2025 The Khronos Group Inc.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 or the MIT License, at your option.
https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenXR-SDK

third_party/openxr/include/openxr/ holds openxr.h, openxr_platform.h and
openxr_platform_defines.h from OpenXR-SDK release-1.1.47, unmodified. They are
not compiled into any binary: the OpenXR layout-diff gate
(crates/cordial-runtime/src/guest_xr.rs) compiles its probe against them, and
tools/vr/gen-guest-xr.py generates the guest's OpenXR tables from the matching
xr.xml, which is not vendored. Each header carries its SPDX line.
